          "id": "sec-3-8",
          "secNumber": "3.8",
          "heading": "Unit project and experiment",
          "content": "## Unit project and experiment\n\n\n\nA 7 m beam supports a secondary beam reaction at a point 2 m from the left support and a uniform load along the entire span. Build accurate reaction, shear and bending diagrams with dimensions. Select two candidate support conditions and examine how the reaction distribution changes. Establish a preliminary shear-reinforcement schedule from an illustrative truss contribution, then clearly separate it from required code expressions and minimum reinforcement. Sketch a bearing node and consider whether a concentrated load near support creates a disturbed region requiring a strut-and-tie model. Show the intended concrete placement sequence and the accessibility of cage corners. Identify which tests or analyses would be needed before detailed design.\n\n\n\n**Deliverable:** A transparent engineering memo with assumptions, diagrams, units, hand-checks, source references and a list of issues that need a governing-code and professional review."
