          "content": "## Unit project and experiment\n\n\n\nFor a 400\u00d7450 mm column with symmetric reinforcement, generate a nominal axial\u2013moment interaction using strain compatibility. Select at least three applied P\u2013M demand pairs; explain whether they appear inside or outside the nominal curve and why nominal comparison is insufficient. Compute the moment from a given eccentricity and list other sources of design moment. Estimate an elastic Euler load with a declared effective length, then discuss why it is not a reinforced-concrete axial design limit. Compare sway and nonsway structural scenarios. Prepare a detailed tie cage with realistic dimensions, check bar fit, and specify that actual strength factors, slenderness and seismic detailing require the governing code.\n\n\n\n**Deliverable:** A transparent engineering memo with assumptions, diagrams, units, hand-checks, source references and a list of issues that need a governing-code and professional review."
