          "content": "## Related interactive simulations\n\n\n\n- [Bond stress and transfer-length demonstration](../labs/lab-bond.html) \u2014 adjust inputs, inspect curves, export data and explain limits of the model.\n\n- [Crack spacing and mean strain transfer](../labs/lab-cracking.html) \u2014 adjust inputs, inspect curves, export data and explain limits of the model.\n\n- [Cracked inertia and span sensitivity](../labs/lab-deflection.html) \u2014 adjust inputs, inspect curves, export data and explain limits of the model.\n\n- [Reinforcement cage and geometric fit](../labs/lab-layout.html) \u2014 adjust inputs, inspect curves, export data and explain limits of the model."
